    "body": "Line: unified geometric route/action/learning integration. Count5/3 ->6/3 on this explicit owner-requested source delivery, no reset. Headline saved437/512 + opened0/128 -> unchanged panel fitting.\n\n## Scope\nFinish the preserved CUDA numerical producer source, sampled graph recovery and isolated multi-episode objective through the existing compiler, exact store, SpiralCore/Claude E8 routing and native emitter. Shared original Vars, transactional rebinding and one global prototype-credit term are preserved. Linear CDF/alias kernels replace dense triangular cumsum/repeated alias scanning. A live episode owner plus native compiler/session/event validation prevents foreign prepared packets from entering teacher credit, even for identical snapshots.\n\n## Evidence and boundaries\nLocal focused source checks:28 whole-path fixtures,3 native grounded-store regressions,5 E8 regressions; library compilation, scoped formatting, whitespace and claim wording. Exact-head rerun/review receipts are posted below before queue admission. Includes nonzero Q4 native parity at three response prefixes, fifteen shared gradient owners without updates, cold replay/next output/gradient reproduction, tampered recovery without mutation, equal-episode credit and all64 end-to-end SpiralCore frame actions.\n\nCUDA-feature build, NVRTC and actual CUDA execution are NOT_RUN; the device fixture is deliberately gated/ignored. No training, optimizer,512 panel, diagnostic,fresh draw,pod rental or peer device borrowing. No model/transfer/speed/energy claim. Optimizer recovery and raw-instrument/FIT remain separate gates. Workspace-wide fmt finds unrelated existing core/integer differences; touched files pass scoped rustfmt and unrelated files are unchanged.\n\nThe earlier disk-blocked UNCOMPILED draft and failed checks are retained in the dated record. Owner-authorized cleanup restored the floor; the checkpoint visibility and reproduced foreign teacher-packet defect were repaired. Exact-head self-review is permitted under current delivery policy. Queue checks are compatibility acknowledgements, not test evidence.\n\nOpposite outcomes: arithmetic/credit/identity/recovery mismatch blocks source activation and must be repaired; source PASS permits protected source delivery and later prospective device/data/FIT qualification, never automatic training. Future unified-bound-content-437 remains NOT_RUN/not FIT-cleared. Training automation remains paused.\n\nCanonical record: docs/labs/whole-path-recovery-2026-10-12/README.md; newest-first current-state, affected README and mechanism brief updated. Prior carry1,644,852,185ms through07:30UTC retained; nonoverlapping preparation/failures/wait/review/delivery charged cumulatively, limit extended to1,679,572,756ms without reset. New owned paid compute$0.\n\nReferences #2030. References #2037.",
