      "body": "EXACT-HEAD SOURCE REVIEW AND CHECKS: 7cc3ad738a991c7e7217a99cd8e75c008bb3ed0b (clean owned worktree).\n\nPASS: rustup Cargo offline training-lib check (11.54s final); whole_path filter28/28 (25.34s final,36.92s test build); native_grounded_session3/3; e8_memory::tests5/5; scoped rustfmt on all five changed Rust files; git diff --check origin/main...HEAD; claim-wording gate. CARGO_TARGET_DIR=target/codex-whole-path, incremental/debug info off,2 jobs/1 test thread, TMPDIR=owned local/tmp and UOR_BUILD_SOURCE_COMMIT=exact head. No optimizer/model run. Target883MiB; disk stayed above30GiB.\n\nSelf-review under current owner delivery policy: compiler/store transaction ordering and prepared-packet validation; exact record identity separate from E8/frame address; canonical frame pullback and all64 end-to-end actions; shared Var ancestry and single global prototype term; failed replay atomicity/RNG/next-output/gradient equality; native nonzero-Q4 Copy/Generate scores at3 response prefixes; alias pooling/gradient and detached CDF; CUDA constructor refuses CPU fallback. The reproduced foreign teacher-packet hole is fixed, including separate live episodes with identical snapshots. No remaining blocker found for this opt-in source/API delivery.\n\nExplicit limitations: CUDA feature build, NVRTC and hardware execution NOT_RUN; source CPU reference is NOT GPU parity. No training, optimizer recovery,512/fresh evaluation, speed or energy qualification. Broad workspace fmt FAILS on existing unrelated core/integer formatting; touched files pass and no unrelated formatting is rewritten. Prior failures and fixture repair are preserved in the record. CI compatibility acknowledgements are NOT test results. This review permits source delivery only; owner training/rental hold and later device/raw-instrument/FIT gates remain intact.",
